Package: libscenefx-0.2
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: WLroots scene API with eye-candy effects (shared library)
 A drop-in replacement for the WLroots scene API that renders surfaces
 with visual effects (rounded corners, shadows, blur) via its FX renderer.
 .
 This package provides the runtime library used by WLroots-based
 compositors such as dwlm.

